0..77 Comment "// Curry\'s paradox, refused at its consumer (#517). A family whose node holds"
78..153 Comment "// a function from the family itself declares: the function\'s domain stands"
154..226 Comment "// strictly below the node, a stratified definition. What refuses is the"
227..303 Comment "// consumer applying the function to the node it was read from, which stands"
304..378 Comment "// at no stage the function takes, directly or through a helper that takes"
379..428 Comment "// the function at its declared type. Shared with"
429..468 Comment "// `../../model/data/stratified.gandr`."
